@title Home-Office Stipend
@subtitle Policy for Larkspur Analytics employees · effective 2027-01-01
@author People Operations

Here is everything you need to know about the new home-office stipend. If something isn't answered here, ask in #finance-help or write to [finance-help@larkspur.example](mailto:finance-help@larkspur.example).

## Who is covered

- Every employee who works from home at least 3 days a week.
- You become eligible after 90 days of service.
- Part-time employees receive 50% of the amounts below.

## What you get

kpi Setup stipend | $500 | one-time, renews every 3 years
kpi Internet and phone | $40 | per month

You can use the setup stipend again 3 years after you first use it.

## What you can buy

The setup stipend covers:

- Desk
- Chair
- Monitor
- Keyboard
- Headset
- Lighting

## How to claim

1. Buy what you need. For anything over $250, get written approval from your manager **before** you buy.
2. Submit your receipts in the expense portal within 60 days of purchase.
3. Your reimbursement arrives within 10 business days.

! Anything over $250 needs written manager approval before you buy it, not after.

## What is not covered

- Gaming equipment
- Furniture for non-work use
- Software subscriptions
- Anything the company already supplies

## Questions?

Ask in the **#finance-help** channel or email [finance-help@larkspur.example](mailto:finance-help@larkspur.example).
